**REGION Log
DateTime.GetCurrentDateTime.Local DateTimeFormat: DateTime.DateTimeFormat.DateAndTime CurrentDateTime=> CurrentDateTime
Text.ConvertDateTimeToText.FromCustomDateTime DateTime: CurrentDateTime CustomFormat: $'''ddMMyyyy-HHmm''' Result=> CurrentDateTimeLog
File.WriteText File: $'''E:\\BillingNote\\Log\\Log-CreateBillingNote-%CurrentDateTimeLog%.txt''' TextToWrite: $'''Start Flow ----- %CurrentDateTime%''' AppendNewLine: True IfFileExists: File.IfFileExists.Overwrite Encoding: File.FileEncoding.Unicode
SET LogPath TO $'''E:\\BillingNote\\Log\\Log-CreateBillingNote-%CurrentDateTimeLog%.txt'''
**ENDREGION
DISABLE CALL DepWithoutCN
DISABLE CALL DepWithCN
CALL SonWithoutCN
CALL SonWithCN
Display.ShowMessageDialog.ShowMessage Title: $'''Test''' Message: 111 Icon: Display.Icon.None Buttons: Display.Buttons.OK DefaultButton: Display.DefaultButton.Button1 IsTopMost: False ButtonPressed=> ButtonPressed
